{"version":1,"content":"<p>前OpenAI首席產品官兼科學團隊負責人凱文·韋爾創辦Warp Sciences，目標是把人工智能與機械人引入藥物研發實驗室，幫助生物科技和製藥公司更快製造、測試候選化合物。韋爾宣佈，公司已完成2.15億美元融資，領投方為Lightspeed；公司估值據稱達到8.65億美元。IVP、Premji Invest、Mayfield、Lux Capital和Menlo Ventures等也參與投資。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583428.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T18:59:37.629981+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":203,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T18:50:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T18:57:55.642616+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T18:57:55.642616+00:00","content_hash":"bb9717d455baa3bf55a0d94c624857b708f55c0cf9fa8d0e426b91796dd030a1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}